essor_verdict_with_no_draft_refuses(tmp_path):\n    line = \"DONE-WHEN: SUCCESSOR changes=2 digest={}\\n\".format(_digest())\n    root, before, after = _merged(tmp_path, verdict=line)\n    minted, refusal = _intake(root, before, after)\n    assert minted == [] and \"no ## Dispositions draft\" in refusal","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2cffbbc6-0175-4e90-b9ab-7b165e0c0246","uuid":"7a32c924-9ac5-4a37-b616-0925bad735ee","timestamp":"2026-10-07T04:57:14.999Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"88314d5f telemetry: session 5b10ff8748334151902ef996766ae2ff ADJUDICATE COMPLETED\na8b84592 WI-841: Re-attest LLR-262, LLR-277 and LLR-278, ruled MEANING at f5f24c2 (rung released)\n98ae3a5f WI-841: Adjudicate the amended cells at f5f24c2: LLR-277, LLR-262 and LLR-278 move meaning\nf5f24c2e WI-841: Answer adjudications 004 and 005 in the lane\n236e2034 WI-841: Re-author the rows adjudications 004 and 005 returned (GPT Terra, round 9)\n1370abed WI-841: Snapshot copies are authorized by registry identity, and an unreadable current spec holds the lane (Sol round 5; adjudication 005, code half)\n?? docs/reviews/wi-841-done-when-blessed-in-lane/007-ADJUDICATE-88314d5.md\n=== test_an_unreadable_current_spec_is_held_naming_why\ndef test_an_unreadable_current_spec_is_held_naming_why(tmp_path):\n    \"\"\"The lane's own copy read at a revision that cannot be read: whether the\n    Done-when changed is unknown, so the hold holds, as for an unreadable claim.\"\"\"\n    _trunk_root, lane = _lane(tmp_path)\n    base = agent_loop.default_base(lane)\n    path, text, why = kdone.spec_at(lane, UNREADABLE, BRANCH, WI)\n    assert (path, text) == (None, None) and \"cannot be read\" in why\n    held = kdone.lane_hold(lane, UNREADABLE, base, BRANCH, [WI])\n    assert held and \"cannot be read\" in held and WI in held\n\n\n=== test_a_claimed_row_whose_spec_is_gone_from_the_lane_is_held\ndef test_a_claimed_row_whose_spec_is_gone_from_the_lane_is_held(tmp_path):\n    \"\"\"A claim 